    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>Your barrier and body move as one unstoppable force. All biotic powers have their action cost <strong>reduced by 1</strong> (minimum 1 action), Biotic Charge restores <strong>5 HP</strong> to your Biotic Barrier, and after using Biotic Charge or Nova your next Strike deals <strong>+1d6 void</strong> damage. While your Biotic Barrier is at full HP, you gain a <strong>+1 status bonus</strong> to attack rolls and damage.</p><p><em>Prerequisite: Improved Vanguard Mastery.</em></p><hr/><p><em>Automation: The +1 to attack and damage switches on by itself whenever your Biotic Barrier is at full HP.</em></p>"
